        "created_at": "2021-03-02T04:48:25.057Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A big one this week as The Prime Wardens square off against OblivAeon.</p>\n<p>The battle starts between the Maerynian Refuge and Fort Adamant (potentially spilling over into the Nexus of the Void, the Ruins of Atlantis and The Court of Blood) - with his Scions, Aeon Master and Progeny first out the gate - and sees PW Argent Adept, PW Captain Cosmic, PW Fanatic, PW Tempest and PW Haka banding together to take on their toughest opponent yet, Oblivaeon.</p>",
