        "id": 235456,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-03-02T17:07:11.149Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Haven’t beaten it yet. I actually restarted, purposefully losing out on the Mint because I needed to rewind too much.</p>\n<p>Though I discovered I hate rewinding in OA mode. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"> When it’s like, still the start of Argent Adept’s turn and I accidentally clicked Tempest instead of Fanatic, so now we have to go back through <em>all that</em> again.</p>\n<p>I was surprised at how easy it was to flip the Shield with this crew. Also at how Argent was kind of hard to manage? Like, you want him where everyone else is, but that’s not necessarily where you want everyone else that round.</p>\n<p>I dropped every Scion, Voss included, and still lost in the third stage to Multiverse destruction. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>",
