        "created_at": "2021-03-04T05:01:03.584Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Phew near mint! Man, Aeon Master is the key to that shield, completely. Use him to make the dudes come out so you can kill them and flip the shield, then kill the Master to disappear his dudes. Then I was off to the races. Obli never feels easy, but boy the second time went way better than my floundering first attempt.</p>",
